        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "支持"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected recipe runs its real source, ordered processors, and outputs in listed delivery order. Vocabulary is mounted where it is used: recognition and correction at STT, glossary context at each AI step." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选配方会使用其实际来源、按顺序运行处理器，并按列表中的交付顺序执行输出。词汇会挂载到实际使用的位置：在 STT 阶段用于识别和纠错，在每个 AI 步骤中作为术语上下文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
