    "You can delete history, notes, model profiles, and permissions in Fonos. Deleting the app removes app-local data managed by iOS. Contact a configured provider about data it may retain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您可以在 Fonos 中删除历史记录、笔记、模型配置和权限。删除 App 会移除由 iOS 管理的本地 App 数据。对于已配置服务提供商可能保留的数据，请联系相应提供商。"
          }
        }
      }
